{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>尼日利亞東北部包奇州11月14日發生嚴重武裝襲擊事件，造成一名中國公民及一名負責護送的當地警員身亡。當地安全部門表示，現已展開大規模搜捕行動，追緝在逃襲擊者。</p><p>外媒報道，上述中國籍外派人員上周六事發時正在該地區一帶進行岩芯鑽探作業。他在乘坐公司車輛並由警察護送期間，突遭疑似武裝匪徒設伏襲擊。</p><p>尼日利亞陸軍第3師當晚約11時19分接獲事件通報，一名機動警察部隊（MOPOL）分隊的警員，奉命保護一名中國公民，期間與武裝分子交火時不幸殉職。當局隨即聯同多個安全機構介入調查並追捕兇徒。</p><figure><img alt=\"尼日利亞國旗：LONDON, ENGLAND - JULY 27: Sinivie Boltic of the Nigeria Olympic wrestling team carries her country's flag during the Opening Ceremony of the London 2012 Olympic Games at the Olympic Stadium on July 27, 2012 in London, England. (Getty Images)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240116/824010799654637568047596.jpeg/jD7k7t4D6TkQynTBFytHfQgAen40YPQO3z4v-98-L_s\"/><figcaption>尼日利亞國旗：LONDON, ENGLAND - JULY 27: Sinivie Boltic of the Nigeria Olympic wrestling team carries her country's flag during the Opening Ceremony of the London 2012 Olympic Games at the Olympic Stadium on July 27, 2012 in London, England. (Getty Images)</figcaption></figure><p>近年，尼日利亞治安持續動盪，針對外國人的襲擊頻生。當地媒體報道，今年10月該國西北部凱比州亦曾發生類似襲擊，導致一名中國公民遇難。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T03:24:56.882933+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":557,"images":1,"source":"HK01 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T02:57:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T03:18:23.572494+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T03:18:23.572494+00:00","content_hash":"e882ecfe9fbdf755ea401d0e1ac35c8fa5d901b64819b89319d3c9a646f54f7a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}